+  // Concurrent local Workers may briefly contend while opening shared SQLite
+  // storage. Classify this before benign compatibility warnings so the existing
+  // bounded SystemError startup retry can recover without recreating any data.
+  if (text.includes("SQLITE_BUSY_RECOVERY")) return new SystemError({
